<title>POLAND: Polish bourse kerb bond deals - November 12.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse kerb bond deals - November 12.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday saw 18,527 variable-interest three-year bonds maturing on November 9, 1997 trading at 100.7 zlotys.</p>
<p>Their turnover was 1.9 million zloyts.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
